\"Batolite is a lighting atelier composing monochrome light — meet the studio, its principles, and write to us about your space. Quotations and catalogue requests answered within two working days.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Batolite,lighting studio,lighting atelier,pendant light,wall light,cylinder wall lamp,concrete pendant,black pendant lamp,monochrome lighting,architectural lighting,interactive lighting showroom,disc pendant light\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://batolite.com/about\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"About &amp; Contact — Batolite\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The house of sculpted light — the studio, the principles, and how to reach us.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://batolite.com/about\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Batolite — Sculpted Light for Contemporary Spaces\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Batolite is a lighting studio crafting monochrome pendants, wall cylinders and discs. Step into the interactive showroom — one live room, five switch groups; flip them and watch the light answer.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://batolite.com/og.jpg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?icon.1d81d5pbbn047.svg\" sizes=\"any\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"T19VSG_variable _8Li5zG_variable OAwBIG_variable antialiased bg-white text-neutral-900\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"flex min-h-screen flex-col bg-white text-neutral-900\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"AboutPage\",\"name\":\"About Batolite\",\"url\":\"https://batolite.com/about\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Batolite Lighting\",\"email\":\"hello@batolite.com\"}}</script><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-neutral-200/70 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-14 max-w-[1400px] items-center justify-between px-5 text-neutral-900 md:h-16 md:px-10\"><a aria-label=\"Batolite — home\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-70\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 \"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0\"><path d=\"M12 2.5v6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M6.75 13.25C6.75 10.9 9.1 9 12 9s5.25 1.9 5.25 4.25H6.75Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"0.55\"></circle></svg><span class=\"leading-none text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.36em] md:text-[13px] md:tracking-[0.42em]\" style=\"margin-right:-0.42em\">BATOLITE</span></span></a><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"flex items-center gap-4 md:gap-9\"><a class=\"relative text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] transition-colors hover:text-black md:text-[11px] md:tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500\" href=\"/products\">Products<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -bottom-1.5 left-0 h-px w-full origin-left bg-neutral-900 transition-transform duration-300 scale-x-0\"></span></a><a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"relative text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] transition-colors hover:text-black md:text-[11px] md:tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-900\" href=\"/about\">About<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -bottom-1.5 left-0 h-px w-full origin-left bg-neutral-900 transition-transform duration-300 scale-x-100\"></span></a><a class=\"relative text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] transition-colors hover:text-black md:text-[11px] md:tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500\" href=\"/about#contact\">Contact<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -bottom-1.5 left-0 h-px w-full origin-left bg-neutral-900 transition-transform duration-300 scale-x-0\"></span></a></nav></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 pt-14 md:px-10 md:pt-20\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900\" href=\"/\">Batolite</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-neutral-300\">/</span><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">About</span></span></nav><div class=\"mt-8\"><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-neutral-400 \" style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">The studio</p><h1 class=\"mt-5 font-extralight leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-5xl md:text-7xl text-neutral-900 \">The house of sculpted<br/><em class=\"font-serif font-light italic\">light.</em></h1></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1400px] grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-5 pb-20 pt-12 md:px-10 md:pb-28 md:pt-16 lg:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-6\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div data-protected=\"true\" class=\"relative select-none overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg ring-1 ring-neutral-900/10\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-700 bg-neutral-100 opacity-100\"></div><canvas role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The Batolite reference apartment fully lit — the studio&#x27;s own reference space\" class=\"block h-full w-full\"></canvas><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10\"></div></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-neutral-400\">The reference apartment — every fitting on.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center lg:col-span-6 lg:pl-8\"><div class=\"reveal \"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-neutral-600 md:text-base\">Batolite is a small lighting atelier. We design few pieces, and we design them slowly — cylinders spun in metal, cones cast in concrete, a disc ground to a razor-thin edge. The reference apartment above is our test room: every switch group you played with on the homepage is our own work, live in a real space.</p><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-neutral-600 md:text-base\">We work with homeowners, interior architects and developers who want light that behaves like part of the architecture — quiet by day, composed after dark.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-neutral-200 bg-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24\"><div class=\"reveal flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between \"><div><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-neutral-400 \" style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">Principles</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-extralight leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-4xl md:text-6xl text-neutral-900 \">Three rules the studio<!-- --> <em class=\"font-serif font-light italic\">keeps.</em></h2></div></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-baseline \"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-neutral-300 md:col-span-2 md:text-4xl\">01</p><h3 class=\"text-xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-neutral-900 md:col-span-4 md:text-2xl\">Light first</h3><p class=\"max-w-xl text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 md:col-span-6\">Every piece begins as a study of where the glow should land — the fixture follows the light, never the other way around.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal \" style=\"transition-delay:60ms\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-baseline \"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-neutral-300 md:col-span-2 md:text-4xl\">02</p><h3 class=\"text-xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-neutral-900 md:col-span-4 md:text-2xl\">One monochrome language</h3><p class=\"max-w-xl text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 md:col-span-6\">Chalk, graphite, raw concrete. The palette stays quiet so a room can speak — and the warm 2700 K source can take over after dark.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal \" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-baseline border-b\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-neutral-300 md:col-span-2 md:text-4xl\">03</p><h3 class=\"text-xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-neutral-900 md:col-span-4 md:text-2xl\">Made to order</h3><p class=\"max-w-xl text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 md:col-span-6\">Each fitting is produced in the atelier, bench-tested, and packed by the people who built it. Nothing sits in a warehouse.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" aria-label=\"Contact the studio\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-neutral-400 \" style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">Contact</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-extralight leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-4xl md:text-6xl text-neutral-900 \">Let’s light your next<!-- --> <em class=\"font-serif font-light italic\">space.</em></h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 md:text-sm\">For quotations, the product catalogue and project pricing, write to the studio — or use the form; it opens your mail app with everything pre-filled. We reply within two working days.</p><dl class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col gap-5\"><div class=\"border-b border-neutral-200 pb-4\"><dt class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Email</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 text-[15px] font-light text-neutral-800\"><a href=\"mailto:hello@batolite.com\" class=\"border-b border-neutral-900/20 transition-colors hover:border-neutral-900\">hello@batolite.com</a></dd></div><div class=\"border-b border-neutral-200 pb-4\"><dt class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Studio hours</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 text-[15px] font-light text-neutral-800\">Sun – Thu · 9:00 – 18:00</dd></div><div class=\"border-b border-neutral-200 pb-4\"><dt class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Catalogue</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 text-[15px] font-light text-neutral-800\">On request — PDF, print quality</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"reveal \"><form class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col gap-7\"><div class=\"grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-2\"><label class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Name</span><input required=\"\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your name\" class=\"w-full border-b border-neutral-300 bg-transparent py-3 text-[15px] text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-neutral-900\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Email</span><input required=\"\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" class=\"w-full border-b border-neutral-300 bg-transparent py-3 text-[15px] text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-neutral-900\" value=\"\"/></label></div><label class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Interested in</span><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"A piece, a project, a catalogue — optional\" class=\"w-full border-b border-neutral-300 bg-transparent py-3 text-[15px] text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-neutral-900\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Message</span><textarea required=\"\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Tell us about the space — size, mood, timeline.\" class=\"w-full border-b border-neutral-300 bg-transparent py-3 text-[15px] text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-neutral-900 resize-none\"></textarea></label><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-neutral-900 bg-neutral-900 px-8 py-3.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white hover:text-neutral-900\">Send the enquiry</button><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"text-[11px] tracking-wide text-neutral-400 transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0\">Your mail app is opening with the enquiry pre-filled — press send there.</p></div></form></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white text-neutral-900\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 py-14 md:px-10 md:py-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\"><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 \"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0\"><path d=\"M12 2.5v6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M6.75 13.25C6.75 10.9 9.1 9 12 9s5.25 1.9 5.25 4.25H6.75Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"0.55\"></circle></svg><span class=\"leading-none text-[13px] font-medium tracking-[0.42em]\" style=\"margin-right:-0.42em\">BATOLITE</span></span><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-500\">Sculpted light for contemporary spaces — made to order in the atelier, bench-tested before it leaves.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Footer\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3\"><a class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900\" href=\"/products\">Products</a><a class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900\" href=\"/about#contact\">Contact</a><a href=\"mailto:hello@batolite.com\" class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900\">hello@batolite.com</a></nav></div><div class=\"mt-12 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-neutral-400 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Batolite Lighting<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><p>Visuals are protected — catalogue on request.</p></div></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script id=\"_R_\">(globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] || (globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] = [])).push({\"otherChunks\":[\"static/chunks/3v_59l1qr_8dp.js\",\"static/chunks/24pmacv9f6q9n.js\",\"static/chunks/20bc24kvaeof-.js\"],\"runtimeModuleIds\":[94553]});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3v_59l1qr_8dp.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qfy96eoyh-ek.js\\\"\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3-fbsx0_9w9jp.js\\\"\\n9:I[51851,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$8\\\"],\\\"ProtectionGuard\\\"]\\na:I[80322,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$8\\\"],\\\"SiteHeader\\\"]\\nb:I[22016,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$8\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\nc:I[94085,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$8\\\"],\\\"Reveal\\\"]\\nd:I[62967,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$8\\\"],\\\"ProtectedImage\\\"]\\n14:\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"\\n15:I[97367,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"$14\\\"]\\n17:\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"\\n18:I[97367,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"$17\\\"]\\n19:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n1b:I[68027,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3_3tqmfs0w0hh.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/01d6212